### 1. Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 2. Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 3. Create Account (paste your token from step 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "accountType": "SAVINGS",
  "initialDeposit": 1000.00
}

### 4. Deposit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "description": "Salary"
}

### 5. Transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "targetAccountNumber": "PASTE_ACCOUNT_NUMBER_HERE",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "description": "Rent"
}

### 6. Transaction History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE